OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry this
OL,6,Fevening. Then the rest of the night
OL,7,Fwill be largely dry with clear
OL,8,Fperiods. Thicker cloud may bring a few
OL,9,Fshowers to the eastern Borders later.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FA few sunny spells, most
OL,12,Flikely in the west, otherwise rather
OL,13,Fcloudy at times. A few showers across
OL,14,FLothians and Borders, mainly over the
OL,15,Fhills. Warm in the southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
