OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FBecoming unsettled with showers or
OL,7,Fspells of rain at times, possibly
OL,8,Fheavy and persistent on Friday. Often
OL,9,Fcloudy in the east, best of any bright
OL,10,Fwarm spells in the west.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
